gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;Karşı cluster'lar Kubernetes'te selector'sız Service + elle yazılmış EndpointSlice ile temsil edilir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;Lab'da DMZ'de tek bileşen ingress-nginx; hedefteki gateway / auth / ratelimit / egress katmanı kırmızı kesikli.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2b2b2b;&quot;&gt;DMZ'den data zone'una yol yok (verify: dmz-a → 172.28.30.2:5432 engelli).&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fffdf3;strokeColor=#d8cfa3;strokeWidth=1.3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="860.0" width="1060.0" height="108.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v108" value="Lejant" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#fafaf8;strokeColor=#c4c4bf;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120.0" y="860.0" width="1060.0" height="212.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v140" value="hedef mimaride olması gereken · lab'da yok" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1f1f1f;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="92.0" y="988.0" width="306.3" height="17.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v141" value="02 · DMZ cluster'ları (dmz-a, dmz-b): namespace'ler, pod'lar, ingress kuralları" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#1f1f1f;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="21.0" width="1191.0" height="33.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v142" value="her kutu bir namespace · satırlar pod'lar (ad · iş yükü · görev) ya da nesneler · kırmızı kesikli = hedefte olması gerek