 registry.k8s.io/ingress-nginx/controller:v1.15.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;&quot;&gt;hostPort :80 · :443 → node IP'si (kind extraPort yok; edge-lb doğrudan node'a gelir)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;&quot;&gt;use-proxy-protocol: true → her bağlantı PROXY başlığıyla başlamalı · real IP = başlıktaki istemci&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;&quot;&gt;proxy-real-ip-cidr: 172.28.10.0/24 (yalnızca edge-lb) · use-forwarded-headers: false (dış XFF'ye güvenmez)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;&quot;&gt;TLS: edge-tls (*.localtest.me) · ssl-redirect (http → https 308) · hsts kapalı (demo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;&quot;&gt;add-headers: X-Dmz=dmz-a · hide-headers: X-Powered-By, Server · server-tokens: false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;&quot;&gt;upstream: EndpointSlice'tan doğrudan pod/IP listesi · proxy-next-upstream error timeout 502-504&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;&quot;&gt;erişim logu JSON: remote_addr · xff · host · upstream · upstream_status · request_time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;&quot;&gt;:10254 /healthz · /metrics (Prometheus) · :8443 admission webhook (Ingress doğrulama)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff1e0;strokeColor=#e39b62;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=0;spacing=2;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="v7"><mxGeometry x="8.0" y="28.0" width="1144.0" height="158.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v10" value='&lt;span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#1f1f1f;font-weight:bold;"&gt;kimlik&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11.5px;color:#3a3a3a;"&gt;ServiceAccount ingress-nginx · RBAC: Ingress, Service, Endpoin